50:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: I'll be back in two weeks at the latest.
51:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: You're sailing through Argonne waters. You have to be careful, that's where King Obius died 200 years ago.
52:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: One of the best sailors in Artidram will accompany me. Don't worry.
53:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: Farewell, Dyron. May the goddess support you.
54:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: This time of year, the Iraqis surface. I'd like to see one again.
55:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: Unless your father is here, we won't be able to.
56:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: I heard the rangers are having a problem with bears.
57:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: Are you getting dinner ready?
58:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: Now that you mentioned it, I'd put something on the grill. Bear meat is too stringy, but it has a few good parts.
59:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: You never pass up a good meal.
60:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: I'd prefer wild boar meat.
61:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: But I'm going to stick to Truth's diet. Bread, wine, and pig sausage will be more than enough for me.
62:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: Yes, you already said you won't change it.
63:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: What was that?
64:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: The noise is coming from the castle. Quick!
65:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: No... Someone's taken Dad's armor.
66:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: I don't think he has good intentions.
67:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: What should I do?
68:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: Tyrio?
69:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: ...
70:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: Prince. Lead all citizens to the western pass. I will hold him off as long as I can.
71:[$FFB1B9]Tyrio[$ffffff]: But...
72:[$FFB1B9]Tamaio[$ffffff]: Quickly!
73:Hold the enemy as long as possible.